// What the offline queue has to say: how many submissions are waiting to go
// out, or which one was overtaken while it waited.
//
// On every page, not only on the form. Somebody who wrote an event with no
// signal and closed the tab has to find out what became of it wherever they
// next open the site, and a message that only exists on the page they have
// left is a message they never see.
---

<p class="outbox-bar" data-outbox-notice role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
